[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13201.59, "timestamp": "03:40:01", "text": "島。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13204.55, "timestamp": "03:40:04", "text": "いいえ。ええと、既にダウンロード済みです。何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13208.229, "timestamp": "03:40:08", "text": "インターネットの速度はどれくらいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13210.07, "timestamp": "03:40:10", "text": "賭けで予想してるよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13212.91, "timestamp": "03:40:12", "text": "それ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13216.87, "timestamp": "03:40:16", "text": "どの男？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13218.469, "timestamp": "03:40:18", "text": "待って、品質が変わると思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13222.269, "timestamp": "03:40:22", "text": "そちら側からも同様に。はい、そうしました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13231.71, "timestamp": "03:40:31", "text": "品質"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.11, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13241.03, "timestamp": "03:40:41", "text": "私にとっては、とても良い状態に見えるからです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13243.75, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "text": "わかった。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13245.429, "timestamp": "03:40:45", "text": "なぜか状況が良くないのですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13249.83, "timestamp": "03:40:49", "text": "あなたのために。ええ、わかっています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13252.07, "timestamp": "03:40:52", "text": "待って、別のものを使うべきだろうか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13254.95, "timestamp": "03:40:54", "text": "クロマキー？多分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13257.99, "timestamp": "03:40:57", "text": "うん、試してみてもいいよ。青を使うべきでしょうか？"}]